 "notes": [
  {
   "html": "<p>With shiitake–kombu dashi it’s fully vegetarian (the eggs are the only animal product).</p>",
   "title_html": "Vegetarian"
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>Your notes didn’t include quantities — these mirror the oyakodon proportions, with 150 g napa standing in for the 150 g chicken.</p>",
   "title_html": "Amounts"
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>Water + ¼ tsp dashi powder, or the soaking water from the shiitake on its own.</p>",
   "title_html": "No homemade dashi?"
  }
