 "slug": "napa-shiitake-egg-bowl",
 "sources": [],
 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<p>Have a bowl of hot rice ready before starting the pan — the egg won’t wait.</p>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-1",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Rice first",
    "how": [],
    "illustration": "illustrations/napa-shiitake-egg-bowl/1.webp",
    "photo": null,
    "result": null,
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 1,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~45 min ahead",
   "title": "Rice first",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "1 bowl (~200 g)",
     "name_html": "Cooked short-grain rice"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Separate the napa stems from the leaves.</li><li>Slice the stems about 1 cm across and chop the leaves.</li><li>Squeeze the soaked shiitake, cut off the stems and slice the caps.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Cut",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Cut a V along each side of the thick white rib to separate the stem from the leaf.",
      "src": "illustrations/napa-shiitake-egg-bowl/2-how1.webp"
     },
     {
      "caption": "Squeeze the soaked shiitake, cut off the stems and slice the caps.",
      "src": "illustrations/napa-shiitake-egg-bowl/2-how2.webp"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/napa-shiitake-egg-bowl/2.webp",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 2,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~5 min",
   "title": "Cut",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "150 g (3–4 leaves); stems sliced 1 cm",
     "name_html": "Napa cabbage"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "3",
     "name_html": "Soaked shiitake"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Mix the sauce:<ul class=\"ing two-col\"><li>shiitake–kombu dashi <span class=\"amt\">80 ml</span></li><li>soy sauce <span class=\"amt\">1 tbsp</span></li><li>mirin <span class=\"amt\">1 tbsp</span></li><li>sake <span class=\"amt\">1 tbsp</span></li><li>sugar <span class=\"amt\">1 tsp</span></li></ul></li><li>Beat the eggs <b>loosely</b> — a few strokes, streaks of white and yolk.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-3",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Sauce and eggs",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Beat loosely — a few quick strokes, cutting through the whites. Stop while streaks remain.",
      "src": "illustrations/napa-shiitake-egg-bowl/3-how1.webp"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/napa-shiitake-egg-bowl/3.webp",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 3,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~2 min",
   "title": "Sauce and eggs",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "2",
     "name_html": "Eggs"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Sauce into the small pan with the napa stems and shiitake.</li><li>Simmer until the stems turn translucent.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-4",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Simmer stems and shiitake",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Bring the sauce to a simmer, then add the stems and shiitake.",
      "src": "illustrations/napa-shiitake-egg-bowl/4-how1.webp"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/napa-shiitake-egg-bowl/4.webp",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 4,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "3–4 min",
   "title": "Simmer stems and shiitake",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Add the leaves, cover and cook until just wilted.</li><li>Napa gives off water — if the pan looks very wet, simmer uncovered for a minute to reduce before the egg.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-5",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Leaves in, lid on",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Pile the leaves on top and cover — they only need a minute or two.",
      "src": "illustrations/napa-shiitake-egg-bowl/5-how1.webp"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/napa-shiitake-egg-bowl/5.webp",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 5,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "1–2 min",
   "title": "Leaves in, lid on",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Drizzle about two-thirds of the egg in a circle over the vegetables.</li><li>Cover until the edges set but the top is still runny.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-6",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Pour ⅔ of the egg",
    "how": [],
    "illustration": "illustrations/napa-shiitake-egg-bowl/6.webp",
    "photo": null,
    "result": null,
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 6,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "30–60 s",
   "title": "Pour ⅔ of the egg",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<p>Pour the remaining egg, cook 10–15 seconds, turn off the heat and cover for 30 seconds — glossy and just set.</p>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "heat off",
    "off": true
   },
   "id": "step-7",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Pour the rest, heat off",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Pour the last third into the middle — then heat off, lid on.",
      "src": "illustrations/napa-shiitake-egg-bowl/7-how1.webp"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/napa-shiitake-egg-bowl/7.webp",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 7,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~45 s",
   "title": "Pour the rest, heat off",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Tilt the pan and slide everything, broth included, over the rice.</li><li>Spring onion greens and shichimi on top.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-8",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Slide onto the rice",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Tilt the pan over the rice and slide everything out in one go, broth included.",
      "src": "illustrations/napa-shiitake-egg-bowl/8-how1.webp"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/napa-shiitake-egg-bowl/8.webp",
